{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"harness:continuous-memory-review:op:auto-1b5e4bba6d6885f944f6c199","layer":"harness","key":"continuous-memory-review","body":"PO指示: ハーネスメモリを常時確認する。開始・再開時、作業切替時、commit/push前、レビュー通知後にharness/projectを正式CLIで取得し、新しい制約・引継ぎを適用する。通知投入、受領、現HEADレビュー、正式receipt、ACKを個別確認する。hookが実行されないAPI環境では手動取得する。同梱HELIX修正は許可、別リポジトリ変更は禁止という既存境界も維持する。","type":"constraint","provenance":{"planId":null,"sessionId":"cli-memory","runtime":"codex","origin":"po-instruction"},"lifecycle":{"state":"active","expiresAt":null,"consumedAt":null,"consumedBy":null},"links":[],"supersedes":null,"createdAt":"2026-09-08T17:02:16.782Z"}
{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"harness:pr-comment-followthrough:op:auto-950af6e0b0f6b9947610c2e5","layer":"harness","key":"pr-comment-followthrough","body":"PO指示: PRコメントも継続確認し、指摘へ対応する。作業再開・切替時と通知後に最新コメントと正式receiptを取得し、対象HEAD・CI・指摘・対応・残件を照合する。過去HEADのapproveを未コミット差分へ適用しない。指摘を読むだけで終えず、修正と検証結果をレビュー対応表へ記録する。","type":"constraint","provenance":{"planId":null,"sessionId":"cli-memory","runtime":"codex","origin":"po-instruction"},"lifecycle":{"state":"active","expiresAt":null,"consumedAt":null,"consumedBy":null},"links":[],"supersedes":null,"createdAt":"2026-09-08T17:03:48.572Z"}
{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"harness:cross-author-pr-review:op:auto-d2b1ce25a33a81f44f9269a8","layer":"harness","key":"cross-author-pr-review","body":"PO指示: PRレビューまたはPRコメント対応後はClaudeへ通知し、変更著者と同じ主体だけでレビューを完結させない。Codex著者の変更はClaudeへ、Claude著者の変更はCodex側で確認し、current HEAD・CI・正式receiptを照合する。自己レビューを承認根拠にしない。","type":"constraint","provenance":{"planId":null,"sessionId":"cli-memory","runtime":"codex","origin":"po-instruction"},"lifecycle":{"state":"active","expiresAt":null,"consumedAt":null,"consumedBy":null},"links":[],"supersedes":null,"createdAt":"2026-09-08T18:07:02.499Z"}
